      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm planning to do a documentary trip through the caucasus/eastern europe area next month. things look a bit intense with all the protests and political stuff lately and i dont want to get in the middle of anything dangerous or messy. \n\nbasically, i'm wondering if u can help me figure out which political groups or factions are generally seen as 'moderate' or 'peaceful' so i can talk to them, and which ones are more 'extremist' or radical so i can steer clear for my own safety? just trying to make sure i focus on the right people for a good, stable story.",
